# ============================================================
# Input File 1 = quarterly physician activity
# Input File 2 = static physician profile
#
# Models:
#   1. XGBoost
#   2. LightGBM
#
# Method:
#   Merge -> time preparation -> lag creation ->
#   next-quarter target -> train/test split ->
#   EDA -> train-only correlation/VIF ->
#   feature selection -> one-hot encoding ->
#   StratifiedGroupKFold -> SMOTE inside folds ->
#   Optuna -> final models ->
#   train/validation/test evaluation ->
#   recall-aware threshold ->
#   SHAP -> physician prediction
#
# IMPORTANT:
# No information from the final test set is used for:
#   - feature selection
#   - imputation fitting
#   - encoding fitting
#   - SMOTE
#   - Optuna
#   - threshold optimization
# ============================================================

